      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْلُوقٌ</span></b>  [pass. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَقَ</span>. When used as
a subst., signifying <i>A creature,</i> or <i>created thing,</i>
its pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْلُوقَاتٌ</span>]. See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلْقٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصِيدَةٌ مَخْلُوقَةٌ</span>
(tropical:)  [<i>An ode that is forged;</i> or] <i>ascribed to a person
not its author.</i> (S, K, * TA.)

